<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 16.7 pct yr/yr in July.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 16.7 pct yr/yr in July.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 16.7 percent year on year in July against a 17.4 percent rise in June, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.553 trillion baht in July from 3.552 trillion in June.</p>
<p>    M-2			July 96     June 96	  July 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	    3.553	 3.552	    3.044</p>
<p>    Percentage change	16.7	 17.4		19.8</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. July figure is estimated.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
